            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a tissue closure device comprising an elongate body; a snare loop at least partially housed within the elongate body; and a tightening element releasably coupled to the snare loop, wherein the tightening element comprises a loop formed between first and second ends, wherein the tightening element comprises an aperture, and wherein the tightening element is configured to decrease a size of the aperture when an area of a tissue within the aperture decreases.</p>
            </abstract>
